---
// Obsidian Gemini Agent Tech & Privacy Section
---

<section class='py-24 sm:py-32 px-6 bg-meg-surface-dark/30 border-t border-meg-border-dark'>
  <div class='mx-auto max-w-7xl'>
    <div class='grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center'>
      
      <!-- Content Side -->
      <div class='gsap-fadein'>
        <h2 class='text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-400 mb-4'>
          Sicherheit & Datenschutz
        </h2>
        <h3 class='text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black tracking-tighter text-meg-text-primary-dark mb-8 leading-tight'>
          Ihre Daten gehören <span class='text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-400 to-violet-500'>Ihnen</span>.
        </h3>
        
        <p class='text-lg text-meg-text-secondary mb-8 leading-relaxed'>
          Der Gemini AI Agent wurde nach dem "Privacy-First"-Prinzip entwickelt. Wir wissen, wie sensibel Daten in einem persönlichen Wissensspeicher sind. Deshalb haben wir höchste Sicherheitsstandards direkt in den Kern des Plugins integriert.
        </p>

        <div class='space-y-6'>
          <div class='flex gap-4'>
            <div class='size-12 rounded-xl bg-meg-bg-dark border border-meg-border-dark flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0'>
              <i class='fa-solid fa-eye-slash text-indigo-400 text-xl' aria-hidden='true'></i>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class='text-lg font-bold text-meg-text-primary-dark mb-1'>Exclusion Lists</h4>
              <p class='text-meg-text-secondary text-sm'>Bestimmen Sie exakt, welche Ordner oder privaten Notizen für die KI unsichtbar bleiben sollen. Absolute Kontrolle über Ihren Kontext.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class='flex gap-4'>
            <div class='size-12 rounded-xl bg-meg-bg-dark border border-meg-border-dark flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0'>
              <i class='fa-solid fa-vault text-indigo-400 text-xl' aria-hidden='true'></i>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class='text-lg font-bold text-meg-text-primary-dark mb-1'>Native Keychain Integration</h4>
              <p class='text-meg-text-secondary text-sm'>Ihre API-Keys werden niemals im Klartext in Obsidian-Konfigurationsdateien gespeichert. Wir nutzen den sicheren Schlüsselbund Ihres Betriebssystems.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class='flex gap-4'>
            <div class='size-12 rounded-xl bg-meg-bg-dark border border-meg-border-dark flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0'>
              <i class='fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-indigo-400 text-xl' aria-hidden='true'></i>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class='text-lg font-bold text-meg-text-primary-dark mb-1'>Kein Tracking</h4>
              <p class='text-meg-text-secondary text-sm'>Es findet keinerlei Tracking oder Datensammlung durch das Plugin statt. Jede Aktion erfolgt lokal auf Basis Ihrer expliziten Anweisungen.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Tech Visual Side (Modern Enterprise Glass Style) -->
      <div class='gsap-fadein relative' style='animation-delay: 0.3s'>
        <div class='relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-meg-border-dark bg-meg-surface-dark/50 backdrop-blur-2xl p-8 shadow-2xl'>
          <div class='absolute top-0 right-0 p-4 opacity-20'>
            <i class='fa-solid fa-microchip text-8xl text-indigo-500' aria-hidden='true'></i>
          </div>
          
          <h4 class='text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-meg-text-secondary mb-6'>
            Technical Specifications
          </h4>

          <div class='space-y-4'>
            {[
              { label: 'Language', value: 'TypeScript' },
              { label: 'AI Engine', value: 'Google Gemini Pro / Flash' },
              { label: 'Architecture', value: 'Event-Driven Function Calling' },
              { label: 'Local Storage', value: 'SQLite / Obsidian Internal' },
              { label: 'Security', value: 'Native OS Keychain (Node-Keytar)' },
              { label: 'Plugin System', value: 'Obsidian API Integration' }
            ].map(spec => (
              <div class='flex justify-between items-center py-3 border-b border-meg-border-dark/50 last:border-0'>
                <span class='text-meg-text-secondary text-sm'>{spec.label}</span>
                <span class='text-meg-text-primary-dark font-mono text-sm font-bold'>{spec.value}</span>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>

          <div class='mt-8 pt-8 border-t border-meg-border-dark/50 flex items-center gap-4'>
             <div class='flex -space-x-2'>
               <div class='size-8 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/20 border border-indigo-500/30 flex items-center justify-center backdrop-blur-sm'>
                 <i class='fa-brands fa-linux text-indigo-400 text-xs'></i>
               </div>
               <div class='size-8 rounded-full bg-violet-500/20 border border-violet-500/30 flex items-center justify-center backdrop-blur-sm'>
                 <i class='fa-brands fa-apple text-violet-400 text-xs'></i>
               </div>
               <div class='size-8 rounded-full bg-blue-500/20 border border-blue-500/30 flex items-center justify-center backdrop-blur-sm'>
                 <i class='fa-brands fa-windows text-blue-400 text-xs'></i>
               </div>
             </div>
             <span class='text-xs text-meg-text-secondary font-semibold'>Vollständiger Cross-Platform Support</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Background decorative elements -->
        <div class='absolute -bottom-10 -right-10 size-64 bg-indigo-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl -z-10'></div>
        <div class='absolute -top-10 -left-10 size-64 bg-violet-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl -z-10'></div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
